 to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary row operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 9 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+{R}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 9 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary row operations are\n\n$\\,$ ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130451/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "908b96db-9463-50b5-89a3-056072c930ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130451"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130459/selection/fcd8be38da3e727db73089ccb8454f24575d6e10ae3ed5047fe87f8a455824b2" :answer/id #uuid "44a6af6f-cb87-529b-a3b4-d09793748a59" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+3{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-2{R}_{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130459/selection/467d029a4c91107a5785f70ee7fcb9a0a328ee99475cd361c0cf843bfe99866a" :answer/id #uuid "7f54cd25-1e53-5a88-8deb-f986bc17ad1b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-2{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130459/selection/8c269b354f55b83bf530838e2c7b6f8f0d7bf4fc70ccff74040edc6556191498" :answer/id #uuid "574d5061-5c55-5862-bb62-3a8cd36a5f21" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-3{R}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}-2{R}_{3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130459/selection/78632d7787b79a9594d2c8b2d10962a3bc54ef7bd51ae3ec81853fb3aa9552a1" :answer/id #uuid "5bc1c691-4b1f-542f-bcf2-e9262b187cc0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}