begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 7 & -12 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nBy applying elementary column operations of the form ${C}_{i}:={C}_{i}+k{C}_{1},$ the matrix $A$ can be transformed into the matrix $B.$ What are the elementary column operations?" :question/worked-solution "To transform $A$ into $B,$ we need to make entries to the right of ${a}_{11}=1$ equal to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary column operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 9 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-{C}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 9\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{3}:={C}_{3}-6{C}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 7 & -12 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary column operations are\n\n$\\,$ ${C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-{C}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{3}:={C}_{3}-6{C}_{1}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-91186/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85e1fe3f-e85e-5ab4-a594-c55b84bb789a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-91186"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130609/selection/cb5fa423fbe6b4f249c2aac9371e7abf18665a6c1c81d77320e31ea44ce1f1de" :answer/id #uuid "12276a9b-f8a5-5909-9e56-d3643e412ffc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-{C}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{3}:={C}_{3}+4{C}_{1}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130609/selection/666cd4ba33a62f6a6eb26bc3793414a659b37fabc9431b600eeed15278958876" :answer/id #uuid "6f2e7224-41d9-5773-9a83-c83ec920b860" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${C}_{2}:={C}_{2}+4{C}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{3}:={C}_{3}+{C}_{1}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130609/selection/3eb1f98c83614d2ca2cdb3e16bc12f46adfcd87c213b6ec19feeb59e87cd48c4" :answer/id #uuid "93e0a2a5-d054-5478-86c2