to the left and to the right of ${a}_{23}=1$ equal to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary column operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 4 & -2 & -3 & -4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-{C}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & -2 & -3 & -4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-3{C}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -4 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -11 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 7 & -3 & -4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{4}:={C}_{4}+2{C}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -4 & 2 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -11 & 4 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 7 & -3 & -10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding elementary column operations are\n\n$\\,$ ${C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-{C}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-3{C}_{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-42929/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "958cdcf3-aaba-5275-85f8-9531f10b3d0e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42929"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42562/selection/7f62f8936451c923d88c7fef1714b1524a58321910af06fd5a31a2eb6ae1d322" :answer/id #uuid "4d22c7e1-baa0-5524-9ef7-e469ddd15a28" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-2{C}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{4}:={C}_{4}+3{C}_{1}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42562/selection/4604e2daddb3b3eb92c431ab6df2160f6590618684d487f6d0d3d32b18854ea1" :answer/id #uuid "a2001ebc-394f-5b1e-8e10-b391053b3f2a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-3{C}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{4}:={C}_{4}+4{C}_{1}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42562/selection/e936ab91fecb6fce4eee792d061dd2c4a146d29ef4d78ce290966a4832c3e07b" :answer/id #uuid "d27dc4a4-0caf-5d0e-8cdf-638e9